                                                "sense_id": "5f1f9523-a887-31d1-addb-88a31952f343",
                                                "text": "The hash mark of rebar or the curve of a hubcap will create curious shapes to be decoded; even, perhaps, entire subway trains and lengths of tracks will remain."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
